    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there isn't a new story? what if the \"pause\" is just a lie we tell ourselves to keep going? i look at everyone else and they're all still creating, still living, and i just feel like a ghost haunting my own life. it feels like it would be more honest to just... accept that the chapter is over. it's so much more peaceful to think about just letting go than to keep pretending there's something coming.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
